      ":question/id": "b046fe29-3c4a-5a05-a5fa-6eeca08035e7",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x+90^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=90^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x+90^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 90^\\circ-\\sin x\\sin 90^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(0\\right)-\\sin x\\left(1\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "6f950bc9-92a1-5a07-872c-16ddfa1c63c3",
